The Colombia compliance skill is complete.

## What I found

The prompt warned that a prior attempt "produced no output file at all." That was wrong — the prior attempt had already written **all seven `references/*.md` files** (2.6 MB total) and only ran out of budget before writing SKILL.md. So I verified the existing references rather than re-deriving them.

